{"id":"tarea","lemma":"tarea","pos":"noun","rank":1389,"glosses":["task","homework"],"ipa":"/taˈɾea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tareas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tarea.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Has terminado tu tarea?","en":"Have you finished your homework?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734317","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"finished"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"¿Has hecho todas tus tareas?","en":"Have you done all your homework?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615985","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Haz tu tarea ya.","en":"Do your homework now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453582","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Esta tarea es difícil.","en":"This task is difficult.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65261","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"difficult"}]},{"text":"Él me ayudó a hacer mis tareas.","en":"He helped me do my homework.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937717","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to help","l":"ayudar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}